</div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"> <div class=\"info\"> <img src=\"https://www.zoller.info/_assets/0d43b51864417824fcf5ebd7b561b543/Images/Info-Icon.svg\"/> <span>Los estudios en la industria automotriz han demostrado que se tarda un promedio de 4,52 minutos en cambiar una herramienta.</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_days_work_year\">Días laborables al año</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_days_work_year\" name=\"days_work_year\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"200\">200</option> <option value=\"210\">210</option> <option value=\"220\">220</option> <option value=\"230\">230</option> <option value=\"240\">240</option> <option value=\"250\">250</option> <option value=\"260\">260</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_shifts\">Turnos por día</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_shifts\" name=\"shifts\"> <option value=\"\"></option> <option selected=\"selected\" value=\"1\">1</option> <option value=\"2\">2</option> <option value=\"3\">3</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_currency\">Moneda</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <select id=\"calculator_currency\" name=\"currency\"> <option data-iso-currency=\"EUR\" data-position=\"after\" data-symbol=\"€\" value=\"€\">€ (EUR)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"USD\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"$\" value=\"$\">$ (USD)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"CAD\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"$\" value=\"$\">$ (CAD)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"MXN\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"$\" value=\"$\">$ (MXN)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"GBP\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"£\" value=\"£\">£ (GBP)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"RUB\" data-position=\"after\" data-symbol=\"₽\" value=\"₽\">₽ (RUB)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"TRY\" data-position=\"after\" data-symbol=\"₺\" value=\"₺\">₺ (TRY)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"INR\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"₹\" value=\"₹\">₹ (INR)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"BRL\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"R$\" selected=\"selected\" value=\"R$\">R$ (BRL)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"JPY\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"¥\" value=\"¥\">¥ (JPY)</option> <option data-iso-currency=\"CNY\" data-position=\"before\" data-symbol=\"¥\" value=\"¥\">¥ (CNY)</option> </select> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_hour_day\">Horas por turno</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_hour_day\" min=\"1\" name=\"hour_day\" type=\"text\" value=\"8\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_machine_costs\">Tarifa horaria de la máquina (<span class=\"currency\"></span>)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_machine_costs\" min=\"1\" name=\"machine_costs\" type=\"text\" value=\"75\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_invest_costs\">Inversión en un dispositivo de preajuste de herramientas ZOLLER(<span class=\"currency\"></span>)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_invest_costs\" min=\"1\" name=\"invest_costs\" type=\"text\" value=\"20000\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-7\"> <label for=\"calculator_productivity\">Ahorro adicional mediante software de gestión de herramientas (%)</label> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5\"> <div class=\"row-input\"> <div class=\"col-xs-10\"> <div class=\"field\"> <input class=\"number-only\" id=\"calculator_productivity\" min=\"1\" name=\"productivity\" type=\"text\" value=\"5\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-2\"> <div class=\"info\"> <img src=\"https://www.zoller.info/_assets/0d43b51864417824fcf5ebd7b561b543/Images/Info-Icon.svg\"/> <span>El software de gestión de herramientas puede aumentar tu productividad al menos en un 5 %; esto ha sido confirmado por investigaciones realizadas por la Universidad RWTH de Aquisgrán (Rheinisch-Westfälische Technische Hochschule Aachen).</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"field-wrapper\"> <div class=\"field submit\"> <button class=\"block-button\" id=\"calc-submit\">Determine su potencial de ahorro ahora </button> </div> </div> </form> <hr/> <div class=\"results\"> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Tus ahorros anuales con una máquina de preajuste y medición ZOLLER</p> <span class=\"sub sub_money_lost\">test</span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"currency\"></span><span class=\"calc_result3\"></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Ahorros adicionales con las soluciones de gestión de herramientas ZOLLER TMS</p> <span class=\"sub sub_savings\"></span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"currency\"></span><span class=\"calc_result5\"></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result total\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <h3 class=\"h3\">Ahorro total con ZOLLER</h3> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <b><span class=\"currency large\"></span><span class=\"large calc_result_total\"></span></b> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"result\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-xs-8 col-sm-8 col-md-9\"> <p>Periodo de amortización de la máquina de ajuste y medición</p> <span class=\"sub sub_roi\"></span> </div> <div class=\"col-xs-4 col-sm-4 col-md-3\"> <div class=\"field\"> <span class=\"calc_result4\"></span> Años </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
